      "term": "lead",
      "example": "The old pipe was made of lead.",
      "originalSense": {
        "id": "kaikki:6c4af84b649b2187ca",
        "definition": "A heavy, pliable, inelastic metal element, having a bright, bluish color, but easily tarnished; both malleable and ductile, though with little tenacity. It is easily fusible, forms alloys with other metals, and is an ingredient of solder and type metal. Atomic number 82.",
